{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > docs/testing.md <<'EOF'\n# Acceptance evidence\n\nUse \"'`node tools/test.mjs` from this folder (or pass its full path). It prints failures and one final count; supporting browser workers return structured JSON. Subsystem filters are core/audio/network/hub/ui/direct/gameplay/package. `evidence/test-all.json` is the comprehensive result, with individual case evidence and screenshots alongside it.\n\n## Behaviour verified\n\n-52deterministic engine/core checks:all25car/course combinations complete legal laps;four profiles/tan-blue equality;analog pressure;countdown and long brake holds;surface effects;ordered forward gates;reverse/missing/parallel/start oscillation/teleport rejection;incident priority;manual recovery;safe staging;lead threshold;winning threshold;deadline draw;five-lap event;complete6-stage tour;route connections/passport;tuning;snapshots;native headless drawing.\n-26actual offline audio checks across Chromium and WebKit:nonzero bounded music/engine/tyres/SFX/voice;exact.10defaultmusic;volumes/mute/pause/stop/destroy;retry loop cleanup.\n-16network adapter unit checks and21real RTC checks each through fileURL/loopback:full gathered SDP,reliable/unreliable channels,sequenced intents/snapshots,150ms/5%loss,malformed/truncated/wrong-type/incompatible descriptions,duplicate reply,old-round rejection,rematch and closure.\n-5official Hub harness scenarios:one/two humans,150ms latency/50ms jitter/5%loss,host departure and actorless server. Every case requires both complete=true and __hubCheck.pass=true. No forbidden custom transport is constructed in Hub.\n-54actual root-file UI checks:all-menu D-pad focus graphs;keyboard/pointing;PS/Xbox prompts;pad reconnect;real controller-confirm file chooser;dev sliders/reset/unranked flag;10secondattract entry and consumed exits via all input devices;save isolation;phone/tablet multitouch steering/brake/cancel/pause;WebKit file boot/input/pause;credits/report navigation. Final touch driving view clears persistent HUD except the menu;teaching and incident cues are transient.\n-Actual direct-game file and loopback playthroughs:visible invitation/reply screens,real text-file import,clipboard rejection,physical car contact,legal lead+1/manual-recovery crash+2,target10,results on both peers,rematch,pause,hidden/stopped-renderer authority,one120Hzcursor,common-clock240seconddeadline,closure. Latency/loss wraps the actual channels,not a replacement transport.\n-36actual root-file gameplay checks:title→all6guidedstages→ending→firstlessonreplay;real keyboard recovery,grass/gravel and actual water crash;all lesson flags true;scored pursuit;classic5laps with5validsplits;versionedbest/ghost and ghostretry;twohuman couchseparation→10pointfinish→rematch→title;no engine/browser errors.\n-Packaging:unchanged official client first aftercharset;root/development file equality;no external scripts/assets/audio;all required metadata/credits/reportsections;exact JSON report shape/parseability.\n\n## Visual evidence\n\n`ui-title-tv.png`,`ui-setup-tv.png`,`ui-race-tv.png`,touch portrait/landscape images,About/Credits pages,world landmark screenshots,results screens and `motion-driving-filmstrip.png` were inspected for road clarity,native shaded style,car heading/wheel/lean motion,readability and clutter. State assertions establish rules;images do not substitute for legal driving or scoring evidence.\n\n## Test limits\n\nTests use the workstation’s installed Chromium153and WebKit26.6 with software rendering,emulated standard controllers and phone/tablet touch. No physical pad,TV,real iOSdevice,human listener or second person was available. Human first-play duration is unknown;scripted driver times are not treated as the new-player pacing target. Public internet/cross-NAT/TURN connectivity is unknown. No FPS target or optimization gate was imposed.\n\nTwelve unique product issues,including two critical completion/replay bugs,were found and fixed. `docs/issues.md` gives each exposure,fix and confirming test. Preventive code-review fixes and fixture corrections are counted separately.\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
